    "implementation_delta": "Publish KitCleanPackage@1. Package discovery includes only ipfs_kit_py and excludes sibling ipfs_accelerate_py / ipfs_datasets_py / external trees. MANIFEST.in prunes sibling gitlinks, recursive IPLD submodules, and archive/backup clutter from the sdist. The full extra no longer pins libp2p@main; named libp2p and ipld-github extras remain source-checkout development extras, not the release profile. Isolated overlay import and a hermetic python -m build wheel+sdist plus pip --no-deps --no-index --target install were observed without sibling trees, sys.path injection, import-time network, or mutable Git-branch release requires. Built artifacts stay in a private temp directory and are not a published PCPR release. Live backends remain typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
